The '''Guardian Defender''' is an {{Epic}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up once the player is {{Skill|fishing|XVII}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Guardian Defender''' can be fished up from any water source with a Water [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]] if the player has {{Skill|Fishing|XVII}}.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Guardian Defender''' is {{Green|130}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|3.03%|1|33.05|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
